# Closeout skill screen

When a material implementation, isolated UAT, migration, or operational task is closed (status updated, flow passed, or user asked to stop):

1. Read `$workflow-saver` once in the same turn as closeout.
2. Screen from this conversation only. Do not treat “validation passed” as a reason to skip.
3. If the screen fails the skill’s repetition/error-prone gates, stay silent.
4. If it passes, give at most one suggestion in the skill’s four-line format and ask for approval. Do not create files until approved.

This screen is part of closeout. It is not extra work after the task is verified.
